Sure! Here's a revised version of the `formatMessage` function:

```javascript
// src/utils/messageFormatter.js
function formatMessage(originalMessage) {
    return originalMessage.split(' ').slice(0, 10).join(' ') + '...';
}
```
This will shorten the message to the first 10 words followed by ellipsis for clarity.
Make sure to run the tests after making changes.
